  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\"><span class=\"kind\">component</span> Security & Crypto</h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>The S-Core Security &amp; Crypto component provides hardware security module (HSM) binding, PKCS#11 cryptographic operations, X.509 certificate management, key derivation, and secure boot verification.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2>Security Architecture &amp; Key Requirements</h2><table class=\"props\"><thead><tr><th>Requirement ID</th><th>Category</th><th>Safety / Security</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>feat_req__crypto__pkcs11_driver</code></td><td>Hardware Security</td><td>Security: HIGH</td><td>Binds cryptographic service routines to hardware trust anchors (HSM, TPM 2.0, Secure Enclaves) via standard PKCS#11 API.</td></tr><tr><td><code>feat_req__crypto__key_storage</code></td><td>Key Management</td><td>Security: YES</td><td>Provides encrypted non-volatile key slots with role-based access control and anti-tamper zeroization.</td></tr><tr><td><code>feat_req__crypto__x509_verification</code></td><td>Certificates</td><td>Security: YES</td><td>Implements offline certificate validation chain with ASN.1 parser and revocation list checks.</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"note\">Extrahierte Anforderungen im <a href=\"../eclipse-score-v0.6.0-curation-review/de/index.html\">S-Core Curation Review Portal</a>.</p>",
   "tail": "\n\n"
  }
 ]
